            "review_title": "Review at Oc Ngon 109",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n1\nExcellent local restaurant in District 5\nJan 2019 • Friends\nI had a late dinner here last week with 3 other close local friends. It is standard outdoor dinning stretching from inside of the restaurant to curb side on low tables and stools. This is no pretense local eating totally packed full of people eating, chatting , laughing drinking and enjoying their friendships and life. It is places like this that I love the most in Vietnam.\n\nWe ordered numerous dishes mainly seafood and some rice and shared it all with cold beers and whisky chasers. an absolutely wonderful evening. The cost? just a fraction of what you would expect to pay anywhere else in the world. Seriously cheap eats.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 10, 2019",
